submission mode (line numbers, anonymous author block); `final`/`preprint`/`nonanonymous` are camera-ready or
preprint modes, not "submission". The template's own limit is nine content pages; the objective's two-page cap is stricter
and governs.

**Compute**: Ibex is a shared SLURM cluster (CPU and GPU nodes, jobs may queue); the world's instructions are to work
